      },
      "message": "feat(a2): prepare Gemini Pro advisory observation plane\n\nPREPARE_ONLY Gemini UI peer slice on the v0.6.7 Browser Operator lineage.\n\n- add minimum gemini.google.com host permission\n- add Gemini-only advisory DOM observer with current semantic selectors\n- validate sender origin in trusted background before storing snapshot\n- keep snapshots in trusted extension-local storage only\n- hard-code advisory_only=true and authority_effect=false\n- keep actuation and remote dispatch disabled\n- preserve existing ChatGPT/GLM ordering and unsupported-platform fail-closed gate\n- add contract tests and research provenance\n\nNo trusted Gemini send path is claimed: current Gemini UI requires real keyboard/paste semantics rather than synthetic DOM insertion for reliable framework state.\n\nauthority_effect=false\nremote_dispatch_enabled=false\nactuation_enabled=false\nddl_applied=false\nsupabase_contract_changed=false\nlive_canary_performed=false",
